;;; ccr4c-finite-char.scm -- A FINITE INTEGRAL DOMAIN HAS PRIME CHARACTERISTIC (CCR-1109-C3 finding F3; used by
;;; CCR.pdf 4.21-4.28 in characteristic 0: the residue field of a local field is finite, so it has a characteristic p,
